# --- North of Booty Bay: the cove, the naga and the gorillas ---
T 595 | Take the road north out of Booty Bay to the pirate cove. The Bloodsail Correspondence lies in the camp, guarded by Bloodsail Raiders and Mages (39-41)
A 597 | From the same papers
C 617 | Naga Explorers (43-44) walk the beach north of the cove; about 1 in 3 drops Akiris Reed
A 349 | Witch Doctor Unbagwa, inland to the east among the gorillas of Mistvale Valley
C 606,349 | Elder Mistvale Gorillas around Unbagwa: Mistvale Giblets drop from about 1 in 3, Gorilla Fangs from about half
T 349 | Hand Unbagwa the fangs. He calls waves of gorillas and then Mokk the Savage (44): stay next to him and kill each wave. Frost Nova and Cone of Cold keep them off you
C 348 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 35.3, 60.4 | Loot the Heart of Mokk
T 606 | Back to Booty Bay: "Shaky" Phillipe on the dock
