# --- Bloodsail camp south of Booty Bay ---
C 604,587 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 29.0, 82.4 | The Bloodsail camp on the shore just south of Booty Bay: kill 10 Swashbucklers and pick up the Bloodsail Charts and Orders lying in the camp. Snuff drops from any Bloodsail pirate. Dizzy's Eye (576) drops only rarely from any Bloodsail, including the ship crews you fight for 608 later, so loot everything. Pull one group at a time, Frost Nova, then Blizzard
T 604 | Fleet Master Seahorn
A 608 | Keep it for the end of this segment: the captains are level 45-48
T 587 | Deeg

# --- Central Stranglethorn: Zanzil, Venture Co., the Skullsplitters and the Jungle Stalkers ---
C 621,609:3 | Ride north-east from Booty Bay to Zanzil's camp. His trolls, zombies and naga (43-44) drop Zanzil's Mixture on about 1 in 3 kills. Chucky "Ten Thumbs" (43) is in the camp: kill him for the ring
C 609:1,609:2 | Maury "Club Foot" Wilkins and Jon-Jon the Crow (43-44) stand together at the ruins north-west of Zanzil's camp: kill both
C 572,196 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 28.5, 46.0 | Jungle Stalkers (40-41), the raptors in the jungle just west of Maury's ruins toward the coast. Kill 10 for Hemet; about 1 in 4 drops a feather for Mok'thardin, so keep going until you have 10. These kills replace part of the grind to 42
C 600 | Venture Co. camp just north of the Crystalvein Mine: the miners, tinkerers and surveyors (40-42) drop Singing Blue Crystals on most kills. Good Blizzard packs
C 585 | Skullsplitter ruins to the north: click the trophy skull piles at Ziata'jai, Balia'mah and Zul'Mamwe (the arrow shows the first two; Zul'Mamwe is the south-east ruin)
C 586,209,598 | Skullsplitter Hunters, Headhunters and Berserkers stand in the Zul'Mamwe ruins; Ana'thek the Cruel (45) walks there and drops the armour. Tusks and necklaces drop from every Skullsplitter, but slowly
L 42 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 45.4, 37.0 | TUGs' troll grind spot: not 42 yet, or still missing tusks or necklaces? Keep killing the Skullsplitter Warriors, Axe Throwers and Mystics (39-40) in these ruins
T 585,586 | Ride west to Grom'gol: the Bubbling Cauldron
A 588 | The cauldron again
T 598,588 | Kin'weelay
A 589
T 572 | Far Seer Mok'thardin. Skip his next quest (571): its Aged Gorilla Sinew is a rare drop from the gorillas near Booty Bay
C 589 | Ironjaw Basilisks (43-44) in and around the Crystalvein Mine, just south of the Venture Co. camp: the shards drop on most kills
T 589 | Back to Grom'gol: Kin'weelay
T 196 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 35.7, 10.8 | Ride north to Hemet Nesingwary. Skip the next part (Tethis, elite)
H Booty Bay | Hearth from Nesingwary's camp (you bound at Booty Bay). Hearthstone on cooldown? Ride back to Grom'gol and fly with Thysta

# --- Booty Bay, then the pirate ships ---
T 609 | "Sea Wolf" MacKinley. He then offers 613, an elite quest: skip it
A 2872 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 27.8, 77.1 | "Sea Wolf" MacKinley. Keep it for Stoley in Steamwheedle Port, Tanaris (next segment)
T 600,621 | Crank Fizzlebub
A 1117 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 26.9, 77.2 | Krazek, beside Crank. Keep it for Kravel Koalbeard on the Shimmering Flats (next segment)
T 209 | Kebok
C 608,576 | The three Bloodsail ships are anchored off the coast south of Booty Bay. Swim out, clear the deckhands and sea dogs (43-45) near each captain one at a time, then kill Captain Stillwater (45-46, east ship) and Captain Keelhaul (46-47, west ship). Fleet Master Firallon (48, south ship) is six levels above you: if your spells keep missing, leave him, keep 608 and finish it at the Booty Bay stop of the 45-48 segment (about level 47). Still no Dizzy's Eye? Any of the ship crews can drop it. Polymorph adds and keep Frost Nova ready
N Cortello's Riddle, a scroll lying on the ship decks, starts 624. Its turn-in is under a bridge in western Swamp of Sorrows and the chain goes on to Dustwallow Marsh and the Hinterlands. This route does not carry it: leave it, or take it only if you will hand it in yourself on a later Stonard visit
T 608 | Fleet Master Seahorn
T 576 | Dizzy One-Eye, a few steps from Seahorn
N Keep these for later segments: 1117 Rumors for Kravel, 1137 News for Fizzle and 1183 Goblin Sponsorship (Shimmering Flats), 2872 Stoley's Debt (Tanaris), 1953 Return to the Marsh (Tabetha), 1261 Marg Speaks (Brackenwall), plus 608 if you left Firallon for later. The next segment starts here with Teleport: Undercity, where you train 42
